{"id":2675,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年03月26日，第十五届全国大学生电子商务“创新、创意及创业”中北大学校内选拔赛顺利举行，校内赛由经济与管理学院负责举办。</p><p> “三创赛”一直秉持着“创新、创意及创业”的宗旨，致力于培养大学生的创新意识、创意思维和创业能力，为高校师生搭建一个将专业知识与社会实践相结合的平台，提供一个自由创造、自主运营的空间。大赛的宗旨是：大赛促进教学，大赛促进实践，大赛促进创造，大赛促进育人。</p><p>全校共有29支队伍报名参加了校内选拔赛，整个比赛过程严谨有序，客观公正，经过十位评委的严格筛选，最终选拔出的结果：特等奖1支队伍、一等奖7支队伍、二等奖10支队伍。结果有效地检验了同学们的创新思维和创业能力，也希望晋级省赛的队伍能再接再厉，积极备战，代表中北大学争取获得更好的成绩！</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozM2RnRQ2MmCZMdzMfL7QkMmlinmN-bM4ffL4CanR7PUm70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyinkh7nSh2ol7ZM4VVM7-8LmlsoR7aoRCaMzCZoRGPMNQFUNnkM8WkMmMFMRlYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-4Lz9bgtA8pUWcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=23189&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/35DDEF9A871E4B42578108605688016F/BDB7BB63/452A5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Vn7728nl-YnRT2nd7QVMmVfLzMRLRG-YLR6RolLPL8UbUN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8nkh7LYyPM7QVU4vbnNnkM778oRvsL7l8M4UaL7nRLm6FUln2L77PM4AFLzCsLmA2gjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yYL47ZoSbw62W8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=23189&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozL2DLmC4oR-YMdmWRozLaL8lZnl7-PL47YU4-4nRvaMNl0gihFp2hmCIa0USysnkhVM1yiLmvsLlUZUmG8o7WfU4LZLzf7nlUZoll4LmVFnN-aLm-ZL7nFL4-aMzCJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-4Lz9bgtA8pUWcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=23189&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A7DE652771D8B048BAC3810DED89E321/FB02280D/32056\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VUz72ZnmL4nmLPLdlUsUNLPoz7aol7-Dn7CZM8-ZL774oll0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZMShRL1h7nNnknlQRMRMRUmARU4AfnllaMzA7ozARMRQFM4vPnNQVUzrFn7CYL4CJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-4Lz9bgtA8pUWcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=23189&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=VozM2RnRQ2MmCZMdzMfL7QkMmlinmN-bM4ffL4CanR7PUm70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyinkh7nSh2ol7ZM4VVM7-8LmlsoR7aoRCaMzCZoRGPMNQFUNnkM8WkMmMFMRlYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-4Lz9bgtA8pUWcc&oid=1280026481